<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Ufirhimon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur Uburhu aka atsɛnge Ufirhimon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ufirhimon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ufrm</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur Uburhu aka atsɛnge</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ufirhimon</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Uburhu aka atsɛnge Ufirhimon</para>
  <para style="ip">Awu Uburhu uner itser Uyesu unga atsɛnge ubvur uwurɛ ru Ufirhimon ri itsi Uonisimu aka awu ugãrhũ Ufirhimon. Abɔɔ agɛ Uburhu atsɛng ubvur ha ri ivangyɛ unga aka awe ru ugborzĩ, ugɛɛ atsɛng ra amɛk aki 60 udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amar Uyesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ ngge itsú Ufirhimon agbishu isiseimbɔ nggu ugãrhãnga Uonisimu, ubinkutsu Uonisimu ashɔi arherhe ri itĩ abɔre uteiyanga Ufirhimon. Anera akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ unga avɛpa ubin uteiyanga ikɛi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ighwe <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imangmang nu ibibema Ufirhimon <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ishishɔ̃rhã ri itsi Uonisimu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imimasha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Ubvur uwirɛ udzeku umum Uburhu, uner ugborzĩ ubinkutsu umum ĩdũwã ri itsi Ukiristo Uyesu, nu ungwɛ̃mɛn Utimoti. Umɛn itsɛnge ubvur uwurɛ ru Ufirhimon uze uwɛrhamɛn nu undɔka itsermɛn, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>nu Uafiya unapumɛn, nu Uarkibu uwuku utɛ̃wã ru udũwã nggu umɛn nu ikikɔng abika adɔsa aki ikɔng ri iyango.<verse eid="PHM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Unum Utɛ nu Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo ama adzaa umbi imimuta nu ididɔɔr.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwɛɛ nu ifɛn-Num</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Ubɛn ivang umum ifɛna-Num ru umbi, umum itar uwɛɛ ru Unum, <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>ubinkutsu umum igũ isarhe imangmango ru Uteijee Uyesu nu ibibemango ru kishoo asarkasar. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Umum ifɛn-Num ungo uma udɛ̃ɛ̃ ugashi imangmango, ngge itsú undzumu ihwihwɛngmbi ra abin aka aze kishoo aka awe akimɛn ri idɔsu Ukiristo. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>A ungwɛ̃mɛn ibibemango iki idzaangge umum anggɔm akarhãrhã nu ififita, ubinkutsu ungo uku utɛnukɔ amɛn abika adɔsa.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu ashɔ̃rhũ Ufirhimon <optbreak/> ri itsi Uonisimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Nu ngge iki iwu ugɛ Ukiristo adzaanga umum ijee umum itsu ungo ukorhu ubinkpi uku imɛ̃ɛ̃ ungo ukorhe, <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>bɔr ibibemamum ru ungo itsu umum ibee ishɔ̃rhã ungo. Umum Uburhu iki iwu ukukũ, ikɛi icɛrɛ umum iki iwu ru ugborzĩ ri itsi imangmangmum ru Ukiristo Uyesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>Umum ishɔ̃rhã ungo ri itsi ungwɛ̃mum Uonisimu, uwuruwi aka adzipa awu ungwɛ̃mum ri imangmang ri ivangyɛ umum iki iwu ri inyãwã. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Ri inggbaashia unga ashia ru ugarh ru ungo, bɔr icɛrɛ unga awu ru ugarh ru ungo nu umum.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Umum idene unga abvui aba ru ungo, uwuruwi umum iki ibema akarhãrhã. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Umum ibee iden unga nggu umum ru unga anyangu ugarhngo ayika umum ivangyɛ umum iki iwe ri inyãwã ubinkutsu ri idũwũ Isarhe Iyiki Ize. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Bɔr umum isi ĩbeemum ikorhu ubinkpi ungo uku usi ibemungo, ngge itsú iyiki izeyɛ ungo uku ikorhe awu ungo ubee ikorhe asi iwea umum itsu ungo.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Ungaa ahwɛng use ibibɔre Uonisimu ru ungo ivanga ukunjiir ngge itsú ungo ubvui uyɛi unga ugbagbaa? <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Asi íbvui awea ugãrhã ukpekũ, bɔr awuri inanga ugãrhã, awuri iwe ru nyaku uze ungwɛ̃mbi. Umum ibema unga, bɔr ungo uwuri ibema unga unango umum ru nyaku ugãrhã nu unerwi aka awe ru imangmang ru Uteijee.<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Nggee ungo uba unyanga umum iwemum uwɛrhitser, uyɛi Uonisimu ru nyaka ungo uku iyɛi umum. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Unga aba ashɔyinga ungo use angwɛ̃ɛ̃ uvɛrhngo, uvarhe kishoo ri itsimum. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Umum, Uburhu, itsɛng itsɛng iyɛrɛ ru ubokmum. Umum ibvui ifasamum ungo, umum iyituwa ungo ugɛ umum idɔsa ungo uvɛrh urhɛngo. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>A ungwɛ̃mɛn, umum ibee ungo ukorha akɛrɛ ubinkutsu umɛn kishoo idɔsu Uteijee. Utɛna amɛnmum ru Ukiristo. <verse eid="PHM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Umum itsɛnga ungo ubinkutsu umum ihwɛng ungo ikorhungo ubinkpi umum iki ĩgɔr ungo. Idzidzɛrhe umum ihwɛng ungo ikorhe unango ubinkpi umum iki ĩgɔr.<verse eid="PHM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Ubina unying uku utoma ikɛi, kabɔɔ uma ugbishuwa ubã umum iki iba itsĩ, ubinkutsu umum ifosa ugɛ ri ifɛn-Nummbi, Unum awuri ikũ umum ibvui ĩbamum ru umbi.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imimashi ighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Uabafara uwuruwi aka awe ru ugborzĩ nggu umum ri idɔsu Ukiristo Uyesu, aghwe ungo. <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Umarku, nu Uaristaku, nu Udima, nu Irhuka abirabɛ aka awe awɛrhi itsermum, ikɛi aghwe ungo.<verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Imimuta iyi Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo iwe nggu umbi.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
